        <div class="col-md-12">
            <div class="page-header text-center my-4">
                <h1>Elections</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="content">
                <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://storage.googleapis.com/juniper-media-library/twpb-bootstrap.min.css?v=17e66469"><style>.sk-page-content img{max-width:100%;}.sk-page-content h1 a,.sk-page-content h2 a,.sk-page-content h3 a,.sk-page-content h4 a,.sk-page-content h5 a,.sk-page-content h6 a{font:inherit;}.sk-page-content table:not([class]){border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;}.sk-page-content table:not([class]) td,.sk-page-content table:not([class]) th{border:1px solid #ccc;padding:3px 5px;vertical-align:top;box-sizing:border-box;}.sk-page-content table:not([class]) th{font-weight:bold;text-align:left;background-color:#f8f9fa;}.column1-1694945148560 {padding:5px 5px 5px 5px;margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;border-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;}.Textblock-1694945198662 {padding:20px 20px 20px 20px;margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;border-radius:0px 0px 0px 0px;}</style><!--jr:content type=page id=620--><div class="sk-page-content twpb-row"><div class="twpb-col-12 twpb-col-lg-12 twpb-col-md-12 column1-1694945148560 "><div  class="Textblock-1694945198662 "><div class="box sectionIntro">
<div class="body">
<h3 style="text-align: center;">Voting &amp; Elections - All Voting Takes Place at Village Hall</h3>
<p style="text-align: center;"><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/juniper-media-library/23/2023/09/Flag_Art_Web.jpg" /></p>
<div class="summary">
<p style="text-align: center;"><strong>Upcoming Elections: November 3, 2026</strong></p>
<div style="text-align: center;"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>Register to Vote or Request an Absentee Ballot:&nbsp; <a href="https://myvote.wi.gov/en-us/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">myvote.wi.gov</a></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>Register to Vote at the Clerk's Office: 5635 S New Berlin Road, Hales Corners, WI 53130 between the hours of 7:30 am and 4:00 PM with proper proof of residency. You must have established residency in Hales Corners at least the last 28 consecutive days prior to any Election Day.&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>We strongly encourage registration&nbsp;<em>prior to election day</em>.&nbsp;</strong><strong>You may register on election day with proper proof of residence of at least 28 days in the Village of Hales Corners containing your current first and last name and residential address.&nbsp;</strong><strong>Election day registration will be done electronically and may result in long and slow lines. You may use a current and valid WI Driver License or ID Card, any official identification card or license issued by a WI governmental body, employee ID card with photo, current property tax bill, residential lease, photo ID from a university along with a fee receipt, utility bill not earlier than 90 days before registration or a bank statement or paycheck.</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Have your document ready before you get into line!</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">Upcoming Election Dates:&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="color: #e03e2d;">General Election - November 3, 2026</span></strong></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong><span style="color: #e03e2d;"><a href="https://storage.googleapis.com/juniper-media-library/23/2026/10/SAMPLE%20BALLOT%20110326.pdf">SAMPLE BALLOT&nbsp; November 3, 2026</a></span></strong></p>
<a href="https://storage.googleapis.com/juniper-media-library/23/2026/09/TYPE%20E%20Notice%2011.03.26-1.pdf">November 3, 2026 -&nbsp; VOTING BY ABSENTEE BALLOT&nbsp;</a></div>
<div class="summary"><br />
<p style="text-align: justify;"><a href="https://storage.googleapis.com/juniper-media-library/23/2026/09/Voting%20System%20Test-Oct%2028.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Voting System Test Notice</a></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><a href="https://storage.googleapis.com/juniper-media-library/23/2026/09/Election-Type%20D%20(11.03.26)-PAPER.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Location and Hours of Polling Place - 11.03.2026</a></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><a href="https://storage.googleapis.com/juniper-media-library/23/2026/09/Off-site%20Voting%20Notice-HC%20Care%20Center%20(10.14.2026).pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Off-Site Voting Notice - Complete Care at Hales Corners</a>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><a href="https://storage.googleapis.com/juniper-media-library/23/2026/09/Off-site%20Voting%20Notice-Forest%20Ridge%20(10.15.26%20&amp;%2010.16.26)%20updated.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Off-Site Voting Notice - Forest Ridge</a></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><a href="https://storage.googleapis.com/juniper-media-library/23/2026/08/08.11.26.pdf">08.11.26 Unoffical Results</a></p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong style="font-size: 18px;"><a class="item" href="https://myvote.wi.gov/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">My Vote WI</a></strong></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="box B_BASIC">
<div class="body">
<article class="summaryDisplay">
<h4><strong><a class="item" href="https://halescornerswi.gov/voter-registration-application-2/">Voter Registration Application</a></strong></h4>
</article>
<article class="summaryDisplay">
<h4><strong><a class="item" href="https://halescornerswi.gov/absentee-ballot-application/">Absentee Ballot Application</a></strong></h4>
</article>
<article class="summaryDisplay">
<h4><strong><a class="item" href="https://halescornerswi.gov/photo-id-information/">Photo ID Information</a></strong></h4>
</article>
<article class="summaryDisplay">
<h4><strong><a class="item" href="https://storage.googleapis.com/juniper-media-library/23/2023/09/Voting_Ward_11x17(1).pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ward Map</a></strong></h4>
<p style="text-align: justify;">Declaration of Non-Candidacy - The following incumbent office holder has filed a Notice of Non-Candidacy for the Spring Election to be held on April 6, 2027:</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>Todd Brinkmeier, Trustee</strong></p>
<p>This information is being posted per Wis Stat &sect;&sect; 8.10(2)(am).&nbsp;&nbsp;A Notification of Non-candidacy is used when a current incumbent (official currently holding office) declares they will not be a candidate for that office at the next election.</p>
<p>If you have any questions, please call the Village Clerk.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>
</article>
</div>
</div></div></div></div><!--/jr:content--><script src="https://storage.googleapis.com/juniper-media-library/twpb-bootstrap.min.js?v=dfb10ed8"></script>
